---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Instant Chefs website handles your staffing enquiry, contact details and links to WhatsApp, email, Instagram and maps."
  cta={false}
>
  <PageHero
    label="Privacy policy"
    title="Your enquiry. Handled with care."
    text="This page explains how information is handled by this website and the contact channels you choose to use."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <article class="container legal-content">
      <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>
      <p>
        The contact form asks for your name, mobile number, location and
        staffing requirement. You may also provide an email address, business
        type, cuisine, experience requirement, salary range, preferred plan and
        a message. Please share only information relevant to your enquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>How the website form works</h2>
      <p>
        Preparing an enquiry creates a message in your browser. This website
        does not send the form to a database or email service, and does not save
        the form in browser storage. Nothing is sent to Instant Chefs when you
        press “Prepare my enquiry”.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you choose “Open WhatsApp” or “Open email”, your prepared message is
        passed to that service as a draft. Review it and send it there if you
        wish. Opening WhatsApp passes the draft in the link to WhatsApp, even
        before you send the message. Those services handle information under
        their own privacy terms.
      </p>
      <h2>When you contact the team</h2>
      <p>
        Information you send through WhatsApp, email or a phone conversation is
        used by the team to understand your staffing requirement and respond to
        your enquiry. Before candidate interviews, discuss with the team which
        details need to be shared for hiring coordination.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies, browser storage and hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This implementation does not set advertising or analytics cookies, and
        does not use browser storage to retain your form details. Fonts and
        website photographs are served with the website. The hosting provider
        may process technical request information such as IP addresses and
        browser information to deliver and protect the website.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to WhatsApp, Instagram and Google Maps take you to third-party
        services. Email links open your chosen email application. Each service
        controls its own data handling. A map is not embedded on this website;
        you choose when to open directions.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
      <p>
        Contact Instant Chefs at{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or{' '}
        <a href={business.tel}>{business.phone}</a> to ask about information you
        have shared, request a correction or discuss deletion. Please avoid
        including sensitive personal documents in an initial enquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>Updates</h2>
      <p>
        If form submission, analytics or other integrations are added, this
        policy should be updated to reflect how those services handle
        information.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
